The linewidths of the laser and the LO were 1 MHz in a 100

Gbit/s 16-QAM coherent system. In this paper, we discuss a

digital phase estimation appropriate for 16-QAM constellation

using a blind carrier recovery algorithm. We show that the tech-

nique can estimate phase ﬂuctuations for laser beat linewidths

of                   in a polarization-multiplexed (POLMUX)

16-QAM coherent system.

